This application bundles third-party components at build time, including
libimobiledevice (LGPL-2.1-or-later) and its dependencies, which are shipped
as separate DLLs alongside the application. Their licenses are staged into
resources/native/licenses/ by scripts/stage-msys2-runtime.sh and are included
in every packaged build. See THIRD_PARTY.md.
